# Build context for `gcloud builds submit` from the repository root, which
# builds the relay image from the root Dockerfile (see
# docs/deployment/runbook-cloud-run.md). Upload only what that Dockerfile
# copies; the rest of the tree is over a gigabyte.
/*
!/Dockerfile
!/Cargo.toml
!/Cargo.lock
!/migrations/
!/crates/
!/nips/
!/tests/
